cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this project when using its architecture, protocols, or benchmark designs."
title: "dwarf_fortress_mcp: A Semantic, Transactional, Replayable Control Plane for Agentic Dwarf Fortress"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Emanuel
    given-names: Jeffrey
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dicklesworthstone/dwarf_fortress_mcp"
license: MIT
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-08-29
abstract: >-
  A design-first, safe-Rust architecture and executable contract scaffold for economical,
  reliable, capability-scoped agent control of Dwarf Fortress through a versioned DFHack bridge,
  canonical semantic state, hash-anchored deltas, immutable plans, bounded obligations,
  evidence-backed verification, deterministic replay, and crash-safe recovery.
keywords:
  - Dwarf Fortress
  - Model Context Protocol
  - autonomous agents
  - DFHack
  - deterministic systems
  - transactional control
